#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:-1
msgid "Kdenlive Tips & Tricks - Smooth Keyframe Interpolation"
msgstr "Kdenlive Tipy a triky – Plynulá interpolácia kľúčových snímok"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:-1
msgid ""
"KDE, Kdenlive, tips, tricks, tips & tricks, useful information, smooth, "
"keyframe, interpolation, editing, documentation, user manual, video editor, "
"open source, free, learn, easy"
msgstr ""
"KDE, Kdenlive, tips, tricks, tips & tricks, useful information,smooth,  "
"keyframe, interpolation, editing, documentation, user manual,video editor,  "
"open source, zadarmo, učiť sa, jednoduché"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:22
msgid "Smooth Keyframe Interpolation"
msgstr "Plynulá interpolácia kľúčových snímok"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:24
msgid ""
"Did you ever wonder why Kdenlive's **smooth interpolation mode may "
"overshoot** between keyframes? And how to tell Kdenlive to avoid such "
"situations?"
msgstr ""
"Premýšľali ste niekedy, prečo **režim plynulej interpolácie Kdenlive môže "
"prestreľovať** medzi kľúčovými snímkami? A ako povedať Kdenlive, aby sa "
"takýmto situáciám vyhol?"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:26
msgid ""
"Let's start to look behind the scenes and introduce you to the strange world "
"of smoothness. Do not worry, there will not be any mathematics for you to "
"learn and understand. Just watch the figures. We will also show you how to "
"avoid such overshots in those situations you do not want it. And for the "
"really curious who want to know what the mathematics behind “smooth” "
"interpolation are there is some :ref:`further reading <ski_further_reading>` "
"in the **Notes** section at the bottom of this page."
msgstr ""
"Začnime sa pozrieť za oponu a predstaviť vám čudný svet plynulosti. "
"Neobávajte sa, nebudete musieť zvládnuť žiadnu matematiku. Stačí sledovať "
"obrázky. Ukážeme vám tiež, ako sa vyhnúť takýmto preleteniam v situáciách, "
"keď to nechcete. A pre skutočne zvedavých, ktorí chcú vedieť, aká matematika "
"sa skrýva za „plynulou\" interpoláciou, je tu :ref:`ďalšie čítanie "
"<ski_further_reading>` v časti **Poznámky** na konci tejto stránky."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:29
msgid "The Fade-In Ramp"
msgstr "Rampa nábehu"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:36
#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:86
#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:129
msgid ""
"Keyframes in the :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"color_image_correction/brightness_keyframable` effect"
msgstr ""
"Kľúčové snímky v efekte :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"color_image_correction/brightness_keyframable`"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:38
msgid ""
"Let's start with a simple ramp, as shown here. We use two keyframes\\ [1]_, "
"one with a low value setting, and the other with a high value setting. The "
"particular values do not matter. We set both keyframes to the interpolation "
"mode :guilabel:`smooth`."
msgstr ""
"Začnime s jednoduchou rampou, ako je znázornená tu. Používame dve kľúčové "
"snímky\\ [1]_, jednu s nízkou hodnotou nastavenia a druhú s vysokou hodnotou "
"nastavenia. Konkrétne hodnoty nie sú podstatné. Obe kľúčové snímky nastavíme "
"na režim interpolácie :guilabel:`plynulý`."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:48
#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:99
#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:135
msgid "Color clip keyframe display"
msgstr "Zobrazenie kľúčových snímok farebného klipu"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:50
msgid ""
"The effect display inside the timeline clip looks like a straight ramp. But "
"if you watch the interpolated values closely while scrubbing the timeline, "
"you should notice that the slope of the ramp varies. At the end and "
"beginning the slope is smaller than in the middle, where it is higher."
msgstr ""
"Zobrazenie efektu vo vnútri klipu na časovej osi vyzerá ako priama rampa. Ak "
"však pri pohybe po časovej osi pozorne sledujete interpolované hodnoty, mali "
"by ste si všimnúť, že sklon rampy sa mení. Na konci a na začiatku je sklon "
"menší ako v strede, kde je väčší."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:52
msgid "But what exactly is going on here?"
msgstr "Čo sa tu však presne deje?"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:64
#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:110
#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:150
msgid "GeoGebra visualization of the Catmull-Rom interpolation"
msgstr "Vizualizácia Catmull-Rom interpolácie v GeoGebre"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:66
msgid ""
"There is this online open source tool |geogebra| for trying out the "
"mathematics inside Kdenlive's MLT engine."
msgstr ""
"Existuje tento online nástroj s otvoreným zdrojovým kódom |geogebra| na "
"vyskúšanie matematiky vo vnútri MLT enginu Kdenlive."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:68
msgid ""
"This figure shows two keyframes P1=0 and P2=1, which is a fairly typical "
"ramp up setting. In case you are already wondering: it does not matter at "
"which exact frames the individual keyframes are."
msgstr ""
"Tento obrázok zobrazuje dve kľúčové snímky P1=0 a P2=1, čo je celkom typické "
"nastavenie nábehu. V prípade, že sa už pýtate: nezáleží na tom, v ktorých "
"presných snímkach sa jednotlivé kľúčové snímky nachádzajú."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:72
msgid ""
"The smooth interpolation that :abbr:`MLT (Media Lovin' Toolkit - An open "
"source software multimedia framework designed and developed for tv "
"broadcasting)` will calculate is drawn as a thick green line. It is bent a "
"little bit like the capital letter S, but then, not really too much."
msgstr ""
"Plynulá interpolácia, ktorú vypočíta :abbr:`MLT (Media Lovin' Toolkit - An "
"open source software multimedia framework designed and developed for tv "
"broadcasting)`, je nakreslená ako hrubá zelená čiara. Je mierne ohnutá ako "
"veľké písmeno S, ale nie príliš."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:74
msgid ""
"And if you look closely, then beginning and ending slope of the green line "
"are not horizontal - at least what could be expected at first."
msgstr ""
"A ak sa pozriete pozorne, sklon zelenej čiary na začiatku a na konci nie je "
"vodorovný – aspoň to by sa dalo na prvý pohľad očakávať."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:76
msgid ""
"You may wonder what the two other keyframes P0 and P3 are good for? Well, "
"the math underneath always requires four keyframes in order to interpolate "
"segment-wise between any two adjacent keyframes. And if there is no "
"preceding (P0) or trailing (P1) keyframe, then we will simple repeat the "
"left (P1) or right (P2) keyframe."
msgstr ""
"Možno sa pýtate, na čo sú dobré dve ďalšie kľúčové snímky P0 a P3? "
"Matematika pod povrchom vždy vyžaduje štyri kľúčové snímky na segmentovú "
"interpoláciu medzi akýmikoľvek dvoma susednými kľúčovými snímkami. A ak "
"neexistuje predchádzajúca (P0) alebo nasledujúca (P1) kľúčová snímka, "
"jednoducho zopakujeme ľavú (P1) alebo pravú (P2) kľúčovú snímku."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:79
msgid "Ramp-Up, and … Overshoot"
msgstr "Nábeh a … prestreľovanie"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:88
msgid ""
"Now let's add a third keyframe, so this looks like a ramp with a plateau. "
"This is shown in the screenshots."
msgstr ""
"Teraz pridajme tretiu kľúčovú snímku, aby to vyzeralo ako rampa s plošinou. "
"Je to znázornené na snímkach obrazovky."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:101
msgid ""
"And now, the ramp gets a clearly visible bump instead of a sharp bend. Well, "
"this looks smooth, but not exactly what we may have intended? So why is this "
"the way it is?"
msgstr ""
"A teraz rampa dostane výrazne viditeľné vybočenie namiesto ostrého ohybu. "
"No, toto vyzerá plynulo, ale nie presne to, čo sme možno zamýšľali? Prečo je "
"to teda tak?"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:112
msgid ""
"This is now our ramp with a plateau: P0=0, P1=1, P2=2. Do not worry about "
"the keyframe numbering, though."
msgstr ""
"Toto je teraz naša rampa s plošinou: P0=0, P1=1, P2=2. Neobávajte sa však "
"číslovania kľúčových snímok."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:114
msgid ""
"Did you expect the plateau to be, well a *straight* plateau? Of course you "
"did. But you may have already noticed that Kdenlive does not exactly behave "
"like this. Instead, the interpolation math causes the interpolated values to "
"overshoot, as you can easily see in the figure."
msgstr ""
"Očakávali ste, že plošina bude, nuž, *rovná* plošina? Samozrejme, že áno. "
"Ale možno ste si už všimli, že Kdenlive sa správa nie celkom takto. Namiesto "
"toho matematika interpolácie spôsobuje, že interpolované hodnoty "
"prestreľujú, ako môžete ľahko vidieť na obrázku."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:116
msgid ""
"What the underlying math does is this: the interpolation is smooth, so that "
"the slope to the *left* of P1 is the same as to the *right* of P1. Yeah, "
"that is a slightly different “smooth” from what you might have been "
"expecting."
msgstr ""
"Čo robí základná matematika, je toto: interpolácia je plynulá, takže sklon "
"*naľavo* od P1 je rovnaký ako *napravo* od P1. Áno, to je trochu iná "
"„plynulosť\" od tej, ktorú ste možno očakávali."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:118
msgid ""
"If you want the plateau to be straight instead, then you must set the "
"interpolation mode of the keyframe P1 to :guilabel:`linear` instead. By the "
"way, this does not change the *previous* smooth segment in any way. And this "
"results in a “rough bent” at P1, but luckily you probably will not notice in "
"most situations."
msgstr ""
"Ak chcete, aby plošina bola namiesto toho rovná, musíte nastaviť režim "
"interpolácie kľúčovej snímky P1 na :guilabel:`lineárny`. Mimochodom, toto "
"žiadnym spôsobom nemení *predchádzajúci* plynulý segment. A to vedie k "
"„hrubému ohybu\" pri P1, ale našťastie si to vo väčšine situácií "
"pravdepodobne nevšimnete."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:123
msgid "Ramp Up-Flat-Down"
msgstr "Nábeh – Rovina – Pokles"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:137
msgid ""
"Let's add another, fourth keyframe, so we have: ramp-up first, then flat, "
"then ramp-down. A fairly typical fade-in and fade-out keyframe template."
msgstr ""
"Pridajme ďalšiu, štvrtú kľúčovú snímku, takže máme: najprv nábeh, potom "
"rovinu, potom pokles. Celkom typická šablóna kľúčových snímok pre náber a "
"úber."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:143
msgid ""
"And look, what is happening: we have got a hump, but not a nice and flat "
"middle section."
msgstr "A pozrite, čo sa deje: máme hrb, ale nie peknú a rovnú strednú časť."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:152
msgid ""
"This time, we look at the middle section P1-P2. To the left, we see the up "
"ramp, to the right, the down ramp."
msgstr ""
"Tentokrát sa pozrieme na strednú časť P1-P2. Naľavo vidíme nábeh, napravo "
"pokles."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:154
msgid ""
"Again, smooth now means that there is no sharp bend in the segments. "
"Instead, the left and right slopes are continuous at P1 and P2; that is, in "
"the middle section. And this causes our interpolated value to overshoot."
msgstr ""
"Opäť, plynulosť teraz znamená, že v segmentoch nie je žiadny ostrý ohyb. "
"Namiesto toho sú ľavý a pravý sklon spojité pri P1 a P2, teda v strednej "
"časti. A to spôsobuje, že naša interpolovaná hodnota prestreľuje."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:159
msgid "Make Flat Great Again"
msgstr "Nechajme plochosť opäť skvelou"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:166
msgid ""
"Smooth keyframes in the :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"color_image_correction/brightness_keyframable` effect"
msgstr ""
"Hladké keyframe v efekte :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/"
"color_image_correction/brightness_keyframable`"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:172
msgid ""
"Now, how do we get a flat top? Fortunately, that is easy to achieve, as you "
"can see from the screenshots."
msgstr ""
"Ako teda dosiahneme plochú časť? Našťastie je to ľahké, ako môžete vidieť na "
"snímkach obrazovky."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:174
msgid "1. keyframe: smooth,"
msgstr "1. keyframe: hladký,"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:175
msgid "2. keyframe: linear (interpolated!),"
msgstr "2. keyframe: lineárny (interpolovaný!),"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:176
msgid "3. keyframe: smooth,"
msgstr "3. keyframe: hladký,"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:177
msgid ""
"4. keyframe: smooth (albeit that does not really matter if there are no "
"further keyframes)."
msgstr ""
"4. keyframe: hladký (hoci to v skutočnosti nehrá rolu, ak nie sú žiadne "
"ďalšie keyframe)."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:184
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "Poznámky"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:208
msgid "**Further Reading**"
msgstr "**Ďalšie čítanie**"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:208
msgid ""
"As you may (or rather may not) remember, Kdenlive's rendering engine is the |"
"mlt_framework|. While :abbr:`MLT (Media Lovin' Toolkit - An open source "
"software multimedia framework designed and developed for tv broadcasting)` "
"has |smooth_interpolation| since around mid-2013, Kdenlive only later caught "
"up and now supports all three interpolation modes linear, discrete, and "
"smooth. As can be seen from the MLT |source_code|, smooth interpolation is "
"done using a |cr_spline|. In particular, MLT uses the so-called *uniform* "
"variant, because it is so simple. The downside is that this smoothing "
"sometimes has the unwanted property of overshooting, especially when you "
"least expect it."
msgstr ""
"Ako si možno (alebo skôr nemusíte) pamätáte, vykresľovacím jadrom Kdenlive "
"je |mlt_framework|. Kým :abbr:`MLT (Media Lovin' Toolkit - An open source "
"software multimedia framework designed and developed for tv broadcasting)` "
"má |smooth_interpolation| približne od polovice roka 2013, Kdenlive to "
"dohnal neskôr a teraz podporuje všetky tri režimy interpolácie: lineárny, "
"diskrétny a hladký. Ako je možné vidieť zo zdrojového kódu MLT |"
"source_code|, hladká interpolácia sa vykonáva pomocou |cr_spline|. Konkrétne "
"MLT používa takzvanú *uniformnú* variantu, pretože je taká jednoduchá. "
"Nevýhodou je, že toto vyhladzovanie má niekedy nežiaducu vlastnosť "
"pretečenia, najmä keď to najmenej čakáte."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:211
msgid "**Sources**"
msgstr "Zdroje"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:211
msgid ""
"The original text was submitted by user *TheDiveO* to the now defunct "
"kdenlive.org blog. For this documentation it has been lifted from |"
"kdenlive_org|, updated and adapted to match the overall style."
msgstr ""
"Pôvodný text bol odoslaný používateľom *TheDiveO* na teraz už nefunkčný blog "
"kdenlive.org. Pre túto dokumentáciu bol prevzatý z |kdenlive_org|, "
"aktualizovaný a prispôsobený tak, aby zodpovedal celkovému štýlu."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/smooth_keyframe_interpolation.rst:215
msgid ""
"You may notice that there are three keyframes: one at frame 0 of the clip, "
"and the two we created for this screenshot. Kdenlive always sets a keyframe "
"at frame 0 of a clip, and we chose to ignore that one for the purpose of "
"this demonstration."
msgstr ""
"Možno si všimnete, že sú tu tri keyframe: jeden na snímke 0 klipu a dva, "
"ktoré sme vytvorili pre tento snímok obrazovky. Kdenlive vždy nastavuje "
"keyframe na snímke 0 klipu a my sme sa rozhodli tento pre účely tejto ukážky "
"ignorovať."

#~ msgid "So great!"
#~ msgstr "To je skvelé!"
